    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>Play for free!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong> 1st zombie shooter EVER where you must physically move your hands in a natural walking motion to run in the game!!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get creative with killing, using various <strong>weapons, explosives, traps  and tools</strong> hidden all over the dark and twisted environments.<br><br></li><li> Pickup random <strong>power-ups </strong>in order to survive just a little longer!<br><br></li><li> There is no animations, everything is<strong> physics-based</strong> movement and interaction.<br><br></li><li> 3<strong> atmospheric</strong> maps with pure <strong>horror </strong>sound effects. ( Several NEW maps coming soon )<br><br></li><li> <strong>60+ weapons </strong>with unique handling and special effects</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong> 1st zombie shooter EVER where you must physically move your hands in a natural walking motion to run in the game!!</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get creative with killing, using various <strong>weapons, explosives, traps  and tools</strong> hidden all over the dark and twisted environments.<br><br></li><li> Pickup random <strong>power-ups </strong>in order to survive just a little longer!<br><br></li><li> There is no animations, everything is<strong> physics-based</strong> movement and interaction.<br><br></li><li> 3<strong> atmospheric</strong> maps with pure <strong>horror </strong>sound effects. ( Several NEW maps coming soon )<br><br></li><li> <strong>60+ weapons </strong>with unique handling and special effects</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Experience the innovative &quot;LOCO&quot; motion VR movement system to grind through hordes of physics-based zombies! Weapons? We give you over 60 tools to unleash Your creativity - guns, explosives, traps, swords, bows, spears! A true first peek into the future of VR movement.",
